  "historyNote": "#8389, eff 7-8-05; ss by #10096, eff 3-3-12; amd by #10164, eff 7-27-12; ss by #10388, eff 7-25-13; amd by #12907, eff 10-23-19; ss by #13126-B, eff 10-24-20; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
